WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Preview an existing starter world before entering.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.750
Choose a starter world. Enter as a guest. Start an encounter and resolve combat on the server.

3
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.000
A real campaign opens with its persisted world and characters.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Select actual combatants through the product controls.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A real attack produces its displayed hit or miss outcome.

6
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.045
Reload your campaign and return to its saved state. This preview shows recorded product interaction.

7
00:00:23.045 --> 00:00:28.000
The recorded campaign and combat remain after a real page reload.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Explore Game Platform. Guest access, combat and saved state shown.
